# Commit only the process and its tools: CLAUDE.md, process/, tools/, study plans and findings, and this file.
# Everything fetched or produced at runtime stays out.

# Run outputs and fetched data (documents, screener and Tapetide answers, call log)
runs/
data/
acknowledgements.md

# Studies: keep each study's plan and written findings; ignore fetched pages and generated tables
studies/*/universe/
studies/*/universe.csv
studies/*/outcomes.csv
studies/*/features.csv
studies/*/sample.csv
studies/*/*.json
studies/*/stages/*.json

# Local settings, caches and scratch
.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
